# Turso is optional. Without these set, the site serves the static
# menu in src/lib/menu-data.ts and stays fully functional.
#
# Create a database with the Turso CLI (`turso db create pizzeria`)
# then fill these in from `turso db show pizzeria` / `turso db tokens create pizzeria`.
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=

# Admin panel (/admin) is also optional. Without this set, /admin
# rejects all logins. Requires TURSO_DATABASE_URL to actually be
# useful — the admin panel edits the database, not the static menu.
# Pick a long random value, not a real password you reuse elsewhere.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
